  "question": {
    "text": "The length of conjugate axis of a hyperbola is greater than the length of transverse axis. Then, the eccentricity e is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "lBqB7",
      "text": "$=\\sqrt{2}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pYJyn",
      "text": "$>\\sqrt{2}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kwlrT",
      "text": "$    < \\sqrt{2}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8E55r",
      "text": "$    < \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the length of conjugate axis $=b$\r\nand the length of transvers axis $=a$ Given that, $b>a$\r\nNow,$b^{2}>a^{2}$\r\n$\\therefore$ Eccentricity $(e)=\\sqrt{1+\\frac{b^{2}}{a^{2}}}$\r\n$e^{2}=\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\frac{b^{2}}{a^{2}}}\\right)^{2}>2$\r\n$e>\\sqrt{2}$",
    "image": null
  },
